sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cl as MCP client (customer's agent)
    participant B as Browser (customer)
    participant RS as MCP server (resource server)
    participant AS as Cassilion login (authorization server)
    Cl->>RS: MCP request without token
    RS-->>Cl: 401 with resource metadata URL and required scope
    Cl->>RS: Fetch protected-resource metadata
    RS-->>Cl: Authorization server = Cassilion login
    Cl->>AS: Discover metadata, identify via Client ID Metadata Document
    Cl->>B: Open authorization URL (PKCE, resource = MCP server URL)
    B->>AS: Sign in (passkey or password + MFA), consent to scopes
    AS-->>B: Redirect with authorization code and issuer
    B-->>Cl: Authorization code
    Cl->>AS: Token request (code verifier, resource)
    AS-->>Cl: Access token: audience = MCP server, scopes limited by plan
    Cl->>RS: tools/call with bearer token
    RS->>RS: Check signature, audience, scope, entitlement, rate limit
    RS-->>Cl: Tool result (AI-written text only after the output guard)
